msgctxt "152"
msgid "Heya, Doc. What's it been, fifteen years?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Well, if it isn't Tatsumi. So you're out of jail now, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"That's right, thanks to you. You were right, Doc... It was easy to get out "
"when I learned to keep my head down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Good. Glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "What exactly did he get out of?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Tatsumi here was in the yakuza, and he was thrown in the slammer some "
"fifteen years ago for something trivial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I've got an idea, Kiryu. Why don't you show Tatsumi around the city? I'll "
"bet he hardly recognizes it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Sorry. I've got things to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Give the guy a break, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"He's been locked up for fifteen years. Can't you show him around for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "It's a deal. I'll show you around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I appreciate that. I don't even know any good places to eat here anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "So long, Doc. Let's go out for a few drinks next time, huh? On me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'll take you up on that. Take care now."
msgstr ""

